<p>MON  Adcock     YR EPS  104.5	  100-112	 96.0</p>
<p>MON  Adcock     YR DIV  39.75	  38-42	   36.0</p>
<p>MON  Dorbyl     H1 EPS  240.7	  234.2-246.0   233.6</p>
<p>MON  Dorbyl     H1 DIV  35.5	   31.5-42.0     30</p>
<p>TUE  Tiger Oats YR EPS  348.3	  344-351	 310.0</p>
<p>TUE  Tiger Oats YR DIV  123.0	  122-124	 108.0</p>
<p>WED  Tongaat    H1 EPS  179.7	  176.2-185.0   150.6</p>
